  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Protecting Ghanas Endangered Sea Turtles at Major Nesting Beaches Throughout the Country</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1)rconduct daily night patrols on 10 km of sea turtle nesting beach within the Muni-Pomadze Ramsar site November 15 -February 28 to protect nests and nesting females and expand to a 20 km beach in Keta that has high leatherbacknesting ; 2) conduct sea turtle conservation education programs in local communities and weekly radio programs about wildlife conservation; and 3) train community members to conduct sea turtle surveys and ecotourism turle walks..</narrative>
  </description>
